{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_02_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_02","title":"歌手","storyCode":"SV-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5de6dee3760364af7237b7a83908df3638fffe587b5a7febc5cc9405639d76d8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"几乎成为废墟的城市里，生活着一群古怪的居民。他们对斯卡蒂这个难得的外来者既冷漠又戒备，双方发生了冲突。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownd"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_02"},{"type":"narration","text":"3:23 P.M. 天气/阴\n伊比利亚，盐风城"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座早已失去生机的城市，半埋在海风味的尘土之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"地图上的地方，就是这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......空气中的味道，算不上好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"另一个男性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"（垂头不语）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有人回应。甚至没有人转过头。他们睁着眼，可是他们一动不动。\n与雕塑的唯一区别是，他们呼吸，缓慢地呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怪物？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们都有着人的形貌，除了过于瘦削，衣衫破旧，和这一路上遇见的伊比利亚人并无差别，与老何塞描述中的怪物相去甚远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是人类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（伊比利亚语）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不这么说了么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（口音稍变的伊比利亚语）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"依旧无人应答。\n斯卡蒂下意识握紧了箱子的把手。\n在外面，她有的是让不愿意开口的人开口的办法。可这样做的前提是，对面的人听懂她说的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......况且，我现在是歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手不这样做事。何塞先生说的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九十九......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个小小的影子跑过街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在说话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她快步追上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九十九。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个......孩子？他在念一个数字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会听错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的项链被......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子从她手里滑开了。他一扭头，往更深的巷子里跑去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九十九，九十九......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么偷我东西？为了把我带到这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂径直踩烂了地上的陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个坑，几条绳。外面那群泥点子的埋伏至少比这像样得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，出来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来也找你们有事。麻烦快点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阴影处，有几尊“雕像”活了过来，慢慢靠近斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"她很古怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，铁皮，这样的人，我没见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你们会说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"流浪歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"流浪歌手，我不知道是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"铁皮，不要跟她说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你的脸，陌生。你的打扮，奇怪。你不是这里的人。你来做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想问一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你的衣服，很新。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你见过我的同伴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你很强壮。你能吃饱饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在我之前来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你的箱子，很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乐器都不轻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你手里拿的，很怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这里的琴，长得也差不多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拨琴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"耳朵，难受。是武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"铁皮，这人，怪。不要理她。说话，好累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"长凳。你放开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长凳......你是说这孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想对他做什么。他拿了我的一样东西。那样东西，很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你是来抢东西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想拿回我的东西，并且找个能听懂我说话的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的孩子，你不许碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的东西，你不许抢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的规则，不许打破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"铁皮，你越走越近了。你想做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"她要伤害我们的孩子，抢我们的东西，破坏我们的规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是我们的姐妹吗？是的话，也有她的一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"她一定不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们听不懂我的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去问别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"不许走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，铁皮......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这里有个坑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"木框的坑。你忘掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，原来真的有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"外面来的人，我们的地方，你不应该来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
